<div class="card card-narrow">
  <h1>Thank you</h1>
  {% if updated %}
    <p>Your correction has been saved. Our team will review your request and get back to you with a Quotation within 24 hours.</p>
  {% else %}
    <p>We've received your quotation request. Our team will review it and get back to you with a Quotation within 24 hours.</p>
    {% if correctionLink %}
      <p class="muted small">We've also emailed you a link in case you spot a mistake and want to correct it before we review your request:</p>
      <p class="muted small" style="word-break:break-all;"><a href="{{ correctionLink }}">{{ correctionLink }}</a></p>
    {% endif %}
  {% endif %}
  <p class="muted small">If you don't hear from us within a couple of days, please check your spam folder or contact us directly.</p>
</div>
